#+TITLE: AutoCAD heap corruption at exit after SCHME historical tests
#+STATUS: NEXT
#+PRIORITY: P1
#+TYPE: bug
#+DEPENDS: native-cad-validation

* Reproduction evidence
SCHME MR339 HEAD04bc0747 pipeline92968 job571171: 23/23, RESTORED,
close-owned.result0, installation/profile restored. Independent read-only Win32
observer retained PID12788/creation639294764853052918 before Quit and observed
native exit3221226356 (C0000374). No process was killed.
The disposable profile log path existed and was isolated to job571171.
ALFE sourcea6636dca (private2.3.96) and shared harness5a502b6 are recorded.

* Scope
The restoration-log defect is independently fixed. The heap failure's originating
writer/component is not identified; do not attribute it to a DLL or to ALFE from
an exit code alone. Relate to the independently documented EPURE clean-profile
exit issue on the newer ALFE development line, but retain the distinct identity.
Native exit zero remains mandatory for qualification. No whitelist or GEP
assertion tolerance may accept this failure.
